d saves `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend`:\\n   - Set `scene.eevee.use_raytracing = False` for fast, crisp graphic NPR rendering.\\n   - Expose a custom property `scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"] = 0.0` (`0.0` = Act I Earth-1610 Miles crimson/indigo/cyan/gold comic; `1.0` = Act II Earth-65 Gwen teal/aquamarine/magenta/peach watercolor expressionism; `2.0` = Act III Earth-928 2099 obsidian/ultraviolet/neon-crimson cyber) and drive `V5_SkyDome` + `LGT_V5Sun` / `LGT_V5SkyFill` / `World` mood shifts from `scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]` (or provide a clean helper/node inputs documented for `anim` to keyframe across frames `1..2161`).\\n   - Build reusable `NG_SV_ComicSurface` (`ShaderNodeBsdfDiffuse -\\u003e ShaderNodeShaderToRGB -\\u003e stepped 3-band ColorRamp`):\\n     * Warm/cool tonal shift: core shadows shift to rich Prussian indigo / deep violet (NEVER muddy black!), saturated midtones, crisp highlights;\\n     * Screen-space (`Texture Coordinate -\\u003e Window`, 16:9 aspect-corrected) **Ben-Day Halftone Dots** in the highlight/midtone transition band + **45-deg Pen Crosshatching Lines** in the shadow terminator band;\\n     * Sharp graphic **Dual Rim Kick** (`Layer Weight -\\u003e Facing` stepped ColorRamp: electric cyan + hot magenta/amber rim highlights on car bodywork, wings, tires, and Halo).\\n   - Convert car \\u0026 track materials cleanly: keep road/kerb specular `0.0` (stylized matte comic asphalt with hand-brushed motion streaks + bold comic red/white/cyan kerbs + painterly grass blocks), preserve `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow`, `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`, `Mat_Caliper_Anodized`, `Mat_FIA_RainLight`, and `Mat_ShiftLED_*` emission keyframes/drivers from `v5_stage_anim.blend` while giving them punchy stylized neon comic saturation!\\n   - **3D Variable-Width Hero Ink Outlines**: Add `Solidify` inverted-hull modifier (`offset=1.0`, `use_flip_normals=True`, `MAT_SV_InkOutline` dark indigo-black emission `(0.012, 0.010, 0.024)` with `use_backface_culling=True` and