II (`f=1602..2161`, Earth-928 2099)**: aggressive Spider-2099 / Prowler-inspired distorted brass-synth bass edge under acceleration + **huge cinematic Sub-Bass Drop + 2-frame rhythmic stutter/impact hit at `f=1698..1699`** (`t_vid = 70.708 s`, Stowe heavy-braking Impact Frame!) and `f=312..313` (`t_vid = 12.958 s`, Village hairpin)!\\n2) Build `pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh` supporting BOTH `--clips` mode (muxing the 3× 4-second showcase clips + stitching `v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4`) AND `--full` mode (for full 2161-frame `renders_v6/frames/f_%04d.jpg` -\\u003e `renders_v6/f1_silverstone_spiderverse_1080p.mp4` when rendered).\\n   - Exact clip frame windows \\u0026 audio start offsets (`t_vid = (f_start - 1) / 24.0`, `96` frames = `4.000 s` each @ 24 fps):\\n     * `clip1_miles_1610.mp4`: `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip1_miles_1610/f_%04d.jpg` (`-start_number 61`, `f=61..156`, audio `ss=2.500`, `t=4.000`)\\n     * `clip2_gwen_65.mp4`: `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip2_gwen_65/f_%04d.jpg` (`-start_number 1290`, `f=1290..1385`, audio `ss=53.708333`, `t=4.000`)\\n     * `clip3_2099_impact.mp4`: `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact/f_%04d.jpg` (`-start_number 1650`, `f=1650..1745`, audio `ss=68.708333`, `t=4.000`)\\n     * `v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4`: concatenates Clip 1 + Clip 2 + Clip 3 with tiny 2-frame dimensional glitch audio/fade micro-joins (`12.0 s`, zero clicks, `TP \\u003c= -1.0 dBFS`).\\n3) Generate \\u0026 verify the 90.04s WAV + M4A now, then wait (`swarm_wait`) for `@anim` to finish rendering `renders_v6/clips_frames/`. As soon as `@anim` hands off, run `bash pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh --clips`, verify all MP4s with `ffprobe`/`volumedetect`, and post handoff naming `@verifier` (`@verifier`: verify 100% V5 isolation, `v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` NPR nodes/outlines/CMYK/Kuwahara/On-Twos, 26 stills + `comic_page_sheet.jpg`, all 4 MP4s, and `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md`, then tag `@coordinator`!).\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 15:21:49\",\"request_id\":\"4c21a4c1-df4e